IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `astar-agency`

-- Agency for Science, Technology and Research Act 1990, ss 4(2), 5, 7(1)(d), 14, 17, 19, 20, 23 and Schedule paras 3, 9, 11, 13 -- worked cases.
