#ASSERT NOT `the disclosure is an offence under section 19` `a member of the public repeating what a grant applicant told them`
#ASSERT NOT `the disclosure is an offence under section 19` `an officer disclosing something not learned through the job`

§ `s 20`

#ASSERT `the use is an offence under section 20` `a symbol identical to the Agency's`
#ASSERT `the use is an offence under section 20` `a symbol so like the Agency's as to be likely to confuse`
#ASSERT NOT `the use is an offence under section 20` `a symbol that resembles the Agency's but is unlikely to confuse`

#ASSERT `the maximum fine in dollars` `unlawful disclosure under section 19` EQUALS 2000
